---
import SiteLayout from '@/layouts/SiteLayout.astro';
---
<SiteLayout
  title="Contact FashionPlusBeauty | Say hello"
  description="Contact FashionPlusBeauty about editorial ideas, press, partnerships and general questions."
  canonicalPath="/contact/"
>
  <section class="static-page-hero" aria-labelledby="contact-title">
    <p class="eyebrow">A note, a question, a good idea?</p>
    <h1 id="contact-title">Say hello.</h1>
    <p>We are always glad to hear from thoughtful people and brands that fit our point of view.</p>
  </section>
  <div class="prose-page">
    <h2>Editorial & general inquiries</h2>
    <p>For story ideas, press notes, corrections or a friendly hello, email <a href="mailto:hello@fashionplusbeauty.com">hello@fashionplusbeauty.com</a>.</p>

    <h2>Partnerships</h2>
    <p>For sponsorships, advertising and brand partnerships, please include the campaign timing, product or service, budget range and the audience you hope to reach. Sponsored content is considered separately from our editorial coverage.</p>
    <p><strong>Before launch:</strong> set up and verify the email inbox above, then replace this address if your public contact email is different. No contact form or subscriber data is collected by this static site yet.</p>

    <div class="contact-card">
      <p class="eyebrow">Work with us</p>
      <strong>Good partnerships start with a good fit.</strong>
      <p>We are building the media kit and partner process. For now, reach out by email and we will be in touch once the inbox is active.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</SiteLayout>
